.SH DESCRIPTION

The
.B auto-network-restart
command restarts network services.  It provides a unoform user
interface across platforms, since the native commands are very
different for each OS.  It also attempts to make it safe to
restart networking remotely, without losing remote access.

.SH RETURN VALUES

0 on success, non-zero error codes otherwise.

